      "Text": "qt6-qt5compat security update",
      "Title": "Synopsis",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for qt6-qt5compat is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1",
      "Title": "Summary",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": ".\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nAn out-of-bounds write vulnerability in the Qt QTextCodec iconv-based encoding of the Qt 5 Compatibility APIs module (Qt Core in Qt 5 and earlier) impacts Qt. Under certain conditions, encoding text with QTextCodec may write outside an internal buffer. This can cause the application to crash and may affect data integrity.(CVE-2026-107590)",
      "Title": "Description",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for qt6-qt5compat is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1.\n\nopenEuler Security has rated this update as having a security impact of low. A Common Vunlnerability Scoring System(CVSS)base score,which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVElink(s) in the References section.",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Low",
      "Title": "Severity",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "qt6-qt5compat",
      "Title": "Affected Component",
      "Type": "General"
    }
  ],
